  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "f9ca09b3-590c-5afb-a90e-540b15673dfb"))
  (text "(1) Two NC channels go to the PNOZ. The third NC is DIO input index 2 only.\n(2) Do not feed cabinet 24 V into S11 or S21. The PNOZ makes the test pulses.\n(3) Set two channels, short detection and a monitored reset. The detent text is TBC.\n(4) Contact 13-14 is STO channel 1. Contact 23-24 is STO channel 2. The section is 0.75 mm2.\n(5) 41-42 is the monitor. Do not use it in the safety path. Its state is TBC.\n(6) 33-34 is spare. Do not load it. Y32 is not a safety output.\n(7) OPEN: the E-stop contact block and the reset button are not chosen.\n(8) The RevPi only reads feedback. Do not claim an ISO 13849 PL.\nNets that leave this sheet are listed on the notes sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4f38ea6-36dd-5525-b954-3ebb2ce8c7b2"))
